    RefIds:
    - rid: 1
      type: {class: BtRoot, ns: CGD.BehaviorTrees, asm: CGD.Runtime}
      data:
        _guid: 1f790dc21b7da2a81c95eee0c15a4b6a
        _position: {x: 0, y: 0}
        _comment: 'The VOID way of holding a fight, as VoidBehaviorTree does it, for the Void tank and support once their own role has nothing to do: a target busy with someone else gets slipped round behind; given the flank role it works round to the target''s side; too close it slips round or backs off; otherwise it skirmishes at medium range, strafing and shooting; lost sight it haunts the likeliest places, comes at the last known position from the side, or holds still and watches. Fails with nothing to do.'
        _children:
        - b6597d00623e07941ee619494d27ca19
    - rid: 2
      type: {class: Selector, ns: CGD.BehaviorTrees, asm: CGD.Runtime}
      data:
        _guid: b6597d00623e07941ee619494d27ca19
        _position: {x: 0, y: 150}
        _comment: 'Slip behind; flank on the coven''s word; back off; skirmish; haunt the belief; come from the side; watch'
        _children:
